{"step_index":425,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T03:06:35Z","thinking":"**Reviewing Location Data**\n\nI'm revisiting the location data, specifically focusing on the search results for Bizno, MarketBiz, and other relevant terms across Naver Maps, Google Maps, and KakaoMap. My goal is to ensure completeness and accuracy, considering various spellings and potential ambiguities. I am hoping to finalize this review and proceed with the next stage soon.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Find remaining missing fields among active companies in the 1,000 rows.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import openpyxl\nimport json\nimport re\n\nfinal_excel_path = r\"C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\오늘\\(데이터검증팀)실사_DB_배현명_1000행_전수정제_최종완성본.xlsx\"\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(final_excel_path, data_only=True)\nws = wb[\"실사DB_1000행_전수정제완료\"]\n\nheaders = [ws.cell(1, c).value for c in range(1, 19)]\n\nremaining_targets = []\n\nfor r in range(2, ws.max_row + 1):\n    vals = [str(ws.cell(r, c).value or '').strip() for c in range(1, 19)]\n    note = vals[1]\n    name = vals[2]\n    biz_no = vals[3]\n    ceo = vals[4]\n    addr = vals[6]\n    phone = vals[7]\n    corp_no = vals[13]\n    \n    is_active = ('폐업' not in note and '휴업' not in note)\n    is_corp = any(kw in name for kw in ['(주)', '주식회사', '㈜', '사단법인', '재단법인', '의료법인', '학교법인', '유한회사', '유한책임회사', '농업회사법인'])\n    \n    missing_items = []\n    if is_active:\n        if not ceo:\n            missing_items.append('ceo')\n        if not addr:\n            missing_items.append('addr')\n        if not phone:\n            missing_items.append('phone')\n        if is_corp and not corp_no:\n            missing_items.append('corp_no')\n            \n    if missing_items:\n        remaining_targets.append({\n            'row_idx': r,\n            'local_id': r - 1,\n            'name': name,\n            'biz_no': biz_no,\n            'ceo': ceo,\n            'addr': addr,\n            'phone': phone,\n            'corp_no': corp_no,\n            'missing': missing_items\n        })\n\nprint(f\"Total remaining targets needing cross-verification & lookup: {len(remaining_targets)}\")\nwith open(r'C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\remaining_targets.json', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(remaining_targets, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n\nprint(\"Saved remaining_targets.json successfully.\")\n","Description":"Find remaining missing fields","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\find_remaining_missing.py","toolAction":"Finding remaining missing fields","toolSummary":"Run find_remaining_missing.py"}}]}
