{"step_index":447,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T03:11:00Z","thinking":"**Pinpointing the Cause**\n\nI've homed in on the exact source. The issue stems from the Bizno website's footer or the tax office information section. It seems the data for the relevant tax offices, specifically Haeundae Tax Office and Bukbusan Tax Office, needs attention.\n\n\n**Refining the Solution**\n\nI've zeroed in on the precise problem: the script was mistakenly pulling footer tax office numbers as company contact numbers when a Bizno page lacked a primary company phone number. Thanks to Bae Hyun-myeong's insight, the solution involves a meticulous cleaning process. I'll scan for all tax office numbers, comparing them against a comprehensive list, and immediately remove them. This refined cleaning script will ensure only authentic company contact information remains, and will enable a rapid correction in the Excel file.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Clean up all tax office phone numbers from the Excel file immediately.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import openpyxl\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment, Border, Side\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\n\nfinal_excel_path = r\"C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\오늘\\(데이터검증팀)실사_DB_배현명_1000행_전수정제_최종완벽본.xlsx\"\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(final_excel_path)\nws = wb[\"실사DB_1000행_전수정제완료\"]\n\ntax_office_numbers = [\n    '051-740-9200', '051-310-6200', '051-580-6200', '051-620-9200',\n    '051-240-0200', '051-810-6200', '051-559-6200', '051-460-6200',\n    '051-780-6200', '126', '051-740-9201', '051-310-6201'\n]\n\ncleaned_count = 0\ncleaned_rows = []\n\nnormal_font = Font(name=\"맑은 고딕\", size=10)\nno_fill = PatternFill(fill_type=None)\n\nfor r in range(2, ws.max_row + 1):\n    name = str(ws.cell(r, 3).value or '')\n    phone_cell = ws.cell(r, 8)\n    fax_cell = ws.cell(r, 9)\n    \n    phone_val = str(phone_cell.value or '').strip()\n    fax_val = str(fax_cell.value or '').strip()\n    \n    # Check phone\n    if phone_val in tax_office_numbers:\n        phone_cell.value = ''\n        phone_cell.fill = no_fill\n        phone_cell.font = normal_font\n        cleaned_count += 1\n        cleaned_rows.append((r, name, f\"전화번호({phone_val}) 세무서번호 삭제\"))\n        \n    # Check fax\n    if fax_val in tax_office_numbers:\n        fax_cell.value = ''\n        fax_cell.fill = no_fill\n        fax_cell.font = normal_font\n        cleaned_count += 1\n        cleaned_rows.append((r, name, f\"팩스번호({fax_val}) 세무서번호 삭제\"))\n\nprint(f\"Total tax office phone numbers cleaned: {cleaned_count}\")\n\n# Save updated Excel\nwb.save(final_excel_path)\nprint(f\"Saved cleaned excel successfully to: {final_excel_path}\")\n","Description":"Clean tax office numbers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\clean_tax_numbers.py","toolAction":"Cleaning tax office numbers","toolSummary":"Run clean_tax_numbers.py"}}]}
